Makefile	- For building proxy
README		- This file

# Proxy source files
proxy.{c,h}	- Primary proxy code
csapp.{c,h}	- Wrapper and helper functions from the CS:APP text

To run the process version, you can do ./proxy -p 8080 or ./proxy --process 8080
For threads: ./proxy -t 8080 or ./proxy --thread 8080


you can use the script test.sh to test for concurrency 

chmod +x test.sh
./test.sh
